WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.955
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.225 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.185 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
02:02.785 --> 02:03.745
Well, well.

5
02:04.945 --> 02:06.305
Lord Han was right.

6
02:06.385 --> 02:09.505
-You really have come up in the world. -You…

7
02:26.585 --> 02:29.065
When I ran into you on the street,

8
02:29.145 --> 02:30.265
you looked so grand,

9
02:30.345 --> 02:32.545
like a goddess descended from Heaven.

10
02:32.625 --> 02:33.585
I hardly recognized you.

11
02:34.225 --> 02:35.425
Thanks to Lord Han,

12
02:36.025 --> 02:37.945
our family is finally reunited, and we siblings can meet again.

13
02:38.025 --> 02:39.545
Come to think of it,

14
02:39.625 --> 02:41.065
you hid yourself awfully well back then.

15
02:41.585 --> 02:45.105
A beauty like you spent every day hauling filth?

16
02:45.185 --> 02:47.985
-If I'd known you were this beautiful… -What?

17
02:48.065 --> 02:50.345
Would you have sold me somewhere disreputable

18
02:50.985 --> 02:52.705
or made me an old man's concubine,

19
02:53.465 --> 02:55.585
just to get money for drinking and gambling?

20
02:56.865 --> 02:58.185
Where are Ma and Hongxian?

21
02:59.745 --> 03:01.665
They're living in luxury at the Han Residence.

22
03:01.745 --> 03:03.265
They've got it good there.

23
03:04.745 --> 03:05.625
Is this real gold thread?

24
03:05.705 --> 03:06.545
How dare you!

25
03:06.625 --> 03:08.225
-You…! -Don't you dare!

26
03:13.705 --> 03:14.825
Whatever you say.

27
03:15.345 --> 03:17.065
I won't waste my time on this clueless maid.

28
03:17.665 --> 03:18.625
Tell me.

29
03:19.305 --> 03:20.385
What does Han Liao want me to do?

30
03:21.105 --> 03:23.985
Lord Han said he didn't care about your true identity.

31
03:24.065 --> 03:26.385
He only wants you to do one thing for him.

32
03:26.465 --> 03:28.225
Once it's done, he'll give you 10,000 liang of gold.

33
03:31.785 --> 03:32.985
What is it?

34
03:33.065 --> 03:34.465
Actually, you don't have to do anything yourself.

35
03:34.545 --> 03:36.145
Lord Han has arranged everything.

36
03:36.745 --> 03:40.345
You just need to find a way to get someone into the ancestral temple,

37
03:40.425 --> 03:42.225
and he'll take care of placing the item.

38
03:45.665 --> 03:47.105
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

39
03:47.185 --> 03:49.145
A-Chou said she'd find a renowned physician for ma,

40
03:49.225 --> 03:52.625
then buy a large residence and bring us there to live in comfort!

41
03:53.385 --> 03:55.745
She also said she'd find me a wife

42
03:56.745 --> 03:59.745
and open a three-story gambling house for me!

43
04:00.465 --> 04:01.625
She hates gamblers.

44
04:01.705 --> 04:03.065
She'd never open one for you.

45
04:03.145 --> 04:04.625
Tell Ma the truth.

46
04:04.705 --> 04:05.905
What else did she say?

47
04:06.505 --> 04:08.625
She also said she was always thinking of you both,

48
04:10.025 --> 04:11.345
and…

49
04:11.945 --> 04:13.825
Runsheng, take good care of Mother.

50
04:14.705 --> 04:16.345
And give Hongxian a message for me.

51
04:17.305 --> 04:18.785
Tell her I've never forgotten her.

52
04:19.384 --> 04:20.745
Last night,

53
04:20.825 --> 04:23.345
I even dreamed about taking her to the market when we were little.

54
04:24.185 --> 04:26.105
She saw a blind girl tapping a cane, singing,

55
04:26.185 --> 04:27.345
and earning lots of money,

56
04:28.025 --> 04:30.505
so she wanted to blind herself and beg for food too.

57
04:31.385 --> 04:32.665
Luckily, I stopped her.

58
04:33.185 --> 04:34.345
Silly girl.

59
04:35.345 --> 04:36.785
A blind girl singing…

60
04:37.345 --> 04:41.305
Could she have been referring to "The Tale of the Red Pill"?

61
04:41.385 --> 04:44.065
HIGH CANDLES BEAR THE RADIANCE

62
04:50.745 --> 04:52.305
Mother, you can rest easy now.

63
04:52.385 --> 04:54.745
She said she'd buy us a big house to settle in.

64
04:54.825 --> 04:56.865
I only hope she finishes what she needs to do soon

65
04:56.945 --> 04:58.265
so we can finally be together again.

66
05:10.945 --> 05:12.265
At least she knows what's good for her.

67
05:13.745 --> 05:15.625
If she keeps stalling,

68
05:15.705 --> 05:17.425
I'll drag them all to the Duke of Ying's residence

69
05:17.505 --> 05:19.625
and turn the whole place upside down.

70
05:20.225 --> 05:22.105
Sir, that woman is cunning and unpredictable.

71
05:22.185 --> 05:23.865
Will she really do your bidding?

72
05:24.945 --> 05:27.345
I've planted more than one mole in the Lu Residence.

73
05:28.345 --> 05:29.985
Someone will make sure she does.

74
05:31.865 --> 05:34.945
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

75
05:35.025 --> 05:36.865
-This table needs a good wipe too. -Yes.

76
05:36.945 --> 05:37.945
Be thorough.

77
05:38.745 --> 05:40.505
-You too, over there. -Yes.

78
05:41.585 --> 05:43.825
Your Ladyship, please inspect the arrangements.

79
05:47.625 --> 05:50.545
Have all the damaged ritual objects been remade?

80
05:50.625 --> 05:51.465
Rest assured.

81
05:51.545 --> 05:53.625
The new ritual objects will arrive this afternoon.

82
05:53.705 --> 05:55.985
I'll inspect every one of them carefully before putting them out.

83
05:56.065 --> 05:59.385
The larger pieces will be placed on the steps outside,

84
05:59.465 --> 06:01.225
and the smaller ones inside the hall.

85
06:02.785 --> 06:04.225
The ancestral temple is short-handed.

86
06:04.305 --> 06:06.345
Her Ladyship finds these men diligent.

87
06:06.425 --> 06:07.705
She wants them to stay and work here.

88
06:10.065 --> 06:11.225
Yes.

89
06:12.665 --> 06:14.465
Are all the offerings ready?

90
06:14.545 --> 06:15.665
Everything is prepared.

91
06:15.745 --> 06:16.665
We've also assigned people to guard them

92
06:16.745 --> 06:19.025
against dogs, insects, and rats.

93
06:19.905 --> 06:22.985
The food and wine for the rites must be clean and carefully prepared.

94
06:23.065 --> 06:24.025
I need to inspect them myself.

95
06:24.105 --> 06:25.625
-Lead the way. -Yes.

96
06:26.585 --> 06:27.825
This way, your Ladyship. Please.

97
06:44.905 --> 06:46.745
Come on, let's go. Time to eat.

98
06:47.385 --> 06:49.465
-Come on, let's eat. Come on, time to eat. -You go ahead. I'll be right there.

99
06:49.545 --> 06:50.585
Time to eat.

100
06:56.745 --> 07:01.625
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

101
07:01.705 --> 07:04.305
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

102
07:10.585 --> 07:11.425
Before I got married,

103
07:11.505 --> 07:13.345
Grandmother had clothes made for me for every season.

104
07:13.945 --> 07:15.985
I won't need anything new for years,

105
07:16.065 --> 07:17.225
so there's no need for this, Mother.

106
07:17.305 --> 07:18.465
That won't do.

107
07:18.545 --> 07:22.065
This ancestral rite is one of the Lu family's grandest occasions.

108
07:22.145 --> 07:25.385
I'm only a woman of the inner chambers.

109
07:25.465 --> 07:26.465
There isn't much else I can help with,

110
07:26.545 --> 07:29.265
but dressing you up is something I can certainly do.

111
07:29.345 --> 07:31.985
I want everyone outside the family to see

112
07:32.585 --> 07:35.145
that my daughter-in-law is perfect in every way,

113
07:35.225 --> 07:36.305
a woman rarely seen in this world.

114
07:36.905 --> 07:38.305
Let's keep looking.

115
07:42.945 --> 07:43.865
This one…

116
07:46.465 --> 07:47.585
This one's nice.

117
07:55.305 --> 07:59.985
My Lady, I sketched the object and quietly showed it to a craftsman.

118
08:00.065 --> 08:03.065
It's a gold ritual vessel reserved for imperial rites.

119
08:05.465 --> 08:07.865
Rao, how do you like this?

120
08:08.865 --> 08:09.865
Rao?

121
08:10.625 --> 08:11.785
What's wrong?

122
08:13.905 --> 08:16.305
Nothing. It's lovely.

123
08:17.145 --> 08:18.025
Let me pick some more.

124
08:22.745 --> 08:25.985
This color would look lovely for the ceremonial robe.

125
08:26.945 --> 08:29.625
Should the sleeves be wide or narrow?

126
08:30.345 --> 08:32.225
Wide. It'll look dignified and elegant.

127
08:32.985 --> 08:36.264
As for the colors of the robe and silk shoes…

128
08:37.985 --> 08:40.305
We'll have to think that through carefully.

129
09:00.545 --> 09:02.185
Lord Han told me to give you a message.

130
09:02.265 --> 09:04.185
Either the entire Lu family dies,

131
09:04.265 --> 09:06.105
or you end up dead yourself.

132
09:06.945 --> 09:09.545
A clever person should know which to choose.

133
09:18.665 --> 09:21.985
Rao, you seem preoccupied.

134
09:22.065 --> 09:22.985
Is something troubling you?

135
09:24.265 --> 09:26.785
There are too many details to handle. My head's spinning from it all.

136
09:28.025 --> 09:28.865
It's all right.

137
09:33.145 --> 09:35.425
Look at this one. What do you think?

138
09:38.305 --> 09:40.945
The pattern is beautiful. You have excellent taste, Mother.

139
09:44.185 --> 09:47.105
No? Is it a little too gaudy?

140
09:47.185 --> 09:48.185
Let's choose another.

141
09:50.345 --> 09:51.345
That one's good.

142
09:51.425 --> 09:52.425
I'll get it.

143
10:00.665 --> 10:04.945
GENTLE AS A SOFT BREEZE

144
10:35.625 --> 10:36.625
Quiet.

145
10:41.945 --> 10:44.025
She usually turns in before the second watch.

146
10:45.265 --> 10:46.385
What's keeping her up tonight?

147
10:47.705 --> 10:50.265
As you instructed, Xu Heng is overseeing this ancestral rite.

148
10:50.865 --> 10:52.785
He's sharp and capable and never makes mistakes.

149
10:52.865 --> 10:54.225
He won't give the her Ladyship any trouble.

150
10:54.865 --> 10:57.545
How about I go find out what's going on?

151
10:58.185 --> 10:59.265
Don't meddle.

152
10:59.865 --> 11:03.665
Find out what happened at the ancestral temple today.

153
11:04.585 --> 11:08.025
Perhaps one of my aunts deliberately gave her a hard time.

154
11:20.265 --> 11:21.785
My Lady, you should run.

155
11:22.385 --> 11:24.545
You've worked so hard to get this far,

156
11:24.625 --> 11:26.865
but Han Liao is using hostages to force your hand.

157
11:26.945 --> 11:28.665
If you do as he says,

158
11:28.745 --> 11:30.465
the entire Lu family will be killed.

159
11:31.065 --> 11:34.225
If you refuse, he'll bring Ms Qiao and her children to our door.

160
11:34.305 --> 11:36.665
Once your true identity is exposed,

161
11:36.745 --> 11:39.025
you'll be facing certain ruin.

162
11:39.625 --> 11:41.425
My Lady, let's leave.

163
11:41.505 --> 11:43.105
Let's get far away from the capital.

164
11:43.185 --> 11:46.025
With all this gold, silver, and jewelry, we can live on it for a year or so.

165
11:50.945 --> 11:51.785
We?

166
11:53.665 --> 11:54.585
Bitao,

167
11:56.065 --> 11:57.625
you'd run away with me?

168
11:58.585 --> 12:02.345
You'd live rough and hide from place to place with me?

169
12:09.145 --> 12:11.025
I'll run away with you, My Lady.

170
12:11.105 --> 12:12.945
Wherever you go, I'll go.

171
12:18.985 --> 12:19.945
Get up.

172
12:22.505 --> 12:23.585
We're not running.

173
12:24.265 --> 12:25.145
Why not?

174
12:25.225 --> 12:26.985
If I were Han Liao,

175
12:27.785 --> 12:30.425
I'd have someone watching my pawn's every move

176
12:30.945 --> 12:32.585
and never let her slip out of my control.

177
12:33.225 --> 12:36.305
Even if we manage to leave the Lu Residence,

178
12:36.385 --> 12:37.345
we still won't make it out of the city.

179
12:37.945 --> 12:40.105
Then are we really going to frame the Lu family?

180
12:40.185 --> 12:41.025
Bitao,

181
12:42.265 --> 12:44.425
if I disregard Ma and Hongxian's lives

182
12:45.345 --> 12:47.105
and refused Han Liao, even to die,

183
12:47.745 --> 12:50.665
he'll simply have someone else do it so he can ruin the Lu family.

184
12:54.185 --> 12:59.265
Han Liao intends to wipe out the Lu clan.

185
13:01.105 --> 13:02.745
Why would he spare me alone?

186
13:04.305 --> 13:09.185
Whether I do it or not, death awaits.

187
13:09.825 --> 13:12.465
Either way, we die.

188
13:12.545 --> 13:13.905
What are we supposed to do?

189
13:21.745 --> 13:23.745
I fought so hard to get where I am.

190
13:26.345 --> 13:28.905
If that villain Han Liao takes even a grain of sand from me,

191
13:31.145 --> 13:32.585
I'll make him pay with his life.

192
13:35.425 --> 13:36.665
There has to be a way out.

193
13:37.305 --> 13:38.745
Let me think.

194
13:39.985 --> 13:41.385
Just let me think.

195
13:44.305 --> 13:45.345
It's getting late.

196
13:45.425 --> 13:46.745
Don't let Lord Lu get suspicious.

197
13:48.585 --> 13:49.665
What did you just say?

198
13:51.345 --> 13:55.585
I mean, we should put out the candles so Lord Lu won't grow suspicious.

199
13:56.425 --> 13:58.185
No. Let him.

200
14:03.945 --> 14:07.065
Bitao, this time,

201
14:09.105 --> 14:10.545
I'll have to bet for my life.

202
14:18.985 --> 14:20.865
My Lord, Guanzhu said

203
14:20.945 --> 14:22.425
Her Ladyship had been troubled

204
14:22.505 --> 14:23.785
ever since she returned from the ancestral temple

205
14:23.865 --> 14:25.265
and didn't even have dinner.

206
14:34.105 --> 14:37.665
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

207
14:49.665 --> 14:51.545
-A centipede! -What happened?

208
14:51.625 --> 14:53.305
My Lady, are you all right?

209
14:53.385 --> 14:55.465
Miss Bitao, where is it?

210
14:55.545 --> 14:57.265
It was right there!

211
14:57.345 --> 15:00.025
How could there be a centipede inside the main hall?

212
15:00.105 --> 15:01.025
Are you sure?

213
15:01.105 --> 15:02.625
What do you mean?

214
15:02.705 --> 15:04.585
This place is full of bricks and timber.

215
15:04.665 --> 15:05.865
Centipedes are bad enough,

216
15:05.945 --> 15:07.505
but blister beetles would be even worse.

217
15:07.585 --> 15:08.865
I am fine if one bites me today.

218
15:08.945 --> 15:10.825
But if one bites the Dowager Lady or Lord Lu tomorrow,

219
15:10.905 --> 15:11.745
you'll be in serious trouble.

220
15:12.665 --> 15:14.905
-Hurry and find them all! -Yes.

221
15:14.985 --> 15:16.665
Search every crack and corner.

222
15:16.745 --> 15:17.705
Look carefully.

223
15:17.785 --> 15:19.545
-You three, over there! Hurry! -Yes.

224
15:21.425 --> 15:24.185
Keep looking carefully. There must be one.

225
15:24.265 --> 15:25.345
All right.

226
15:27.185 --> 15:30.785
Bitao, we've cleared away every cobweb and ant nest in the hall.

227
15:30.865 --> 15:32.745
How could there be a centipede?

228
15:32.825 --> 15:33.705
You must have been mistaken.

229
15:36.705 --> 15:37.945
Steward Xu,

230
15:39.745 --> 15:41.145
I've finished checking the offerings.

231
15:41.225 --> 15:43.265
You've done a good job, but…

232
15:44.265 --> 15:45.985
your Ladyship, is something amiss?

233
15:50.225 --> 15:51.225
Never mind.

234
16:06.385 --> 16:07.425
You…

235
16:08.905 --> 16:09.745
My Lord.

236
16:09.825 --> 16:10.865
FIVE JADE TIGERS

237
16:10.945 --> 16:13.505
Are the items marked in red all damaged ritual objects?

238
16:13.585 --> 16:16.465
My Lord, 18 ritual objects were damaged.

239
16:16.545 --> 16:19.025
Replacements were made wherever possible.

240
16:24.225 --> 16:26.425
Where are the damaged ones kept?

241
16:26.505 --> 16:29.425
The ritual vessels and jades are all accounted for.

242
16:29.505 --> 16:30.505
None may go missing or be discarded.

243
16:31.145 --> 16:33.865
By the old rules, even sentimental things, worn or broken,

244
16:33.945 --> 16:36.385
still have to be carefully stored in the rear rooms.

245
16:37.105 --> 16:37.985
Good. At least there are rules.

246
16:39.345 --> 16:40.345
Fetch Zhao Song and Zhao Bai.

247
16:41.065 --> 16:43.265
Have them check every damaged object against this register.

248
16:43.345 --> 16:44.345
Yes.

249
16:48.465 --> 16:49.945
Why did you summon me, My Lord?

250
16:51.265 --> 16:52.665
Is this what you've been hiding from me?

251
16:55.185 --> 16:56.425
What do you mean, My Lord?

252
16:57.225 --> 16:58.425
I don't understand.

253
16:58.505 --> 17:00.065
You're still covering for them?

254
17:00.145 --> 17:02.185
We've checked all the fragments in the rear rooms.

255
17:02.265 --> 17:05.905
Six damaged celadon pieces are missing, and a jade tiger has vanished.

256
17:07.145 --> 17:08.345
Even a passing goose leaves a trace.

257
17:08.944 --> 17:10.305
There's no way shattered jade leaves no trace.

258
17:10.985 --> 17:14.145
They marked them as damaged and thought they could get away with it.

259
17:14.785 --> 17:16.825
These ritual objects have been passed down in the Lu family for generations.

260
17:17.464 --> 17:18.825
What a brazen thief!

261
17:20.545 --> 17:23.184
My Lord, I'll catch the thief!

262
17:23.265 --> 17:25.145
I'm afraid the thief is one of our own!

263
17:26.464 --> 17:27.865
Please calm down, My Lord.

264
17:29.105 --> 17:31.545
The ancestral temple was managed by the second branch.

265
17:32.585 --> 17:33.905
If you make a scene,

266
17:33.985 --> 17:36.225
Aunt Chengjun may be embarrassed.

267
17:36.305 --> 17:38.305
Investigate! Investigate thoroughly!

268
17:40.265 --> 17:41.345
My Lord…

269
17:48.585 --> 17:49.425
Zhao Song, Zhao Bai.

270
17:50.345 --> 17:51.425
Shut the gates at once.

271
17:51.505 --> 17:54.265
Take men and detain every servant who regularly enters the temple.

272
17:54.345 --> 17:57.025
Question them thoroughly and search the entire place.

273
17:57.905 --> 18:01.065
Perhaps the ritual jade hasn't been smuggled out yet.

274
18:01.865 --> 18:02.705
-Yes. -Yes.

275
18:02.785 --> 18:04.025
Wait!

276
18:05.105 --> 18:07.225
You know I've only just married into the family

277
18:07.305 --> 18:09.305
and want to avoid offending my elders.

278
18:09.385 --> 18:10.425
Why make such a fuss?

279
18:11.305 --> 18:13.665
Your Ladyship, damage is often reported at the ancestral temple.

280
18:13.745 --> 18:15.065
Of course the masters know about it.

281
18:15.145 --> 18:18.105
They simply turn a blind eye to avoid unnecessary trouble.

282
18:18.185 --> 18:20.265
But the jade tiger was bestowed by the Founding Emperor.

283
18:20.345 --> 18:22.185
If the Duke checks the inventory, you'll certainly be held responsible.

284
18:22.265 --> 18:24.225
-His Lordship doesn't want you blamed. -What are you waiting for? Go!

285
18:26.105 --> 18:26.945
Go!

286
18:33.505 --> 18:35.065
Oh no! Something's been stolen from the ancestral hall again.

287
18:35.665 --> 18:37.145
I've heard it's a jade tiger.

288
18:37.225 --> 18:38.985
Who would dare steal ritual jade?

289
18:39.065 --> 18:41.425
Exactly. Who'd dare steal something so valuable?

290
18:41.505 --> 18:42.545
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

291
18:45.225 --> 18:48.465
-What's going on? -Seize every servant in this courtyard.

292
18:48.545 --> 18:49.825
Lock them separately in the rear rooms!

293
18:51.105 --> 18:52.065
-Move! -I'm innocent!

294
18:52.145 --> 18:52.985
-Hurry! -I'm no thief!

295
18:53.065 --> 18:54.185
I'm innocent! I swear!

296
18:54.265 --> 18:55.105
-I'm innocent! -Move!

297
18:55.185 --> 18:56.305
Why are you taking me?

298
18:56.385 --> 18:57.505
I'm innocent!

299
18:58.745 --> 19:00.145
I've been wronged!

300
19:00.225 --> 19:01.305
Can Liangcai handle it?

301
19:02.185 --> 19:05.585
His mother begged me again and again to let her come kowtow to you.

302
19:05.665 --> 19:08.385
Her whole family has been given easy, respectable posts.

303
19:08.465 --> 19:10.425
If they can't even handle this small task,

304
19:10.505 --> 19:12.265
they'd be too ashamed to face you.

305
19:14.025 --> 19:15.025
General Qi.

306
19:15.865 --> 19:17.145
Not here again?

307
19:17.225 --> 19:19.665
Fine. The Lu family's ancestral temple, right?

308
19:20.345 --> 19:21.585
I'll go there myself.

309
19:24.065 --> 19:25.345
General Qi, please wait.

310
19:25.425 --> 19:26.305
I have a message for you.

311
19:26.905 --> 19:28.585
Lady Rao has a question for you.

312
19:29.265 --> 19:31.625
Does the promise you made that day still stand?

313
19:33.265 --> 19:34.865
If anything ever troubles you,

314
19:35.465 --> 19:36.345
just tell me.

315
19:36.425 --> 19:39.385
I'll help without hesitation.

316
19:40.185 --> 19:43.585
Every word I said to her was sincere.

317
19:44.225 --> 19:46.465
Her Ladyship has an urgent favor to ask.

318
19:46.545 --> 19:48.625
She hopes you won't ask questions and just do as she asks.

319
19:49.225 --> 19:50.985
Her Ladyship will remember this favor.

320
19:56.225 --> 19:57.545
Miss Bitao!

321
19:58.545 --> 19:59.865
Miss Bitao.

322
19:59.945 --> 20:01.545
Miss Bitao, you're finally here!

323
20:01.625 --> 20:02.585
I'm not a thief.

324
20:02.665 --> 20:05.425
Please tell the her Ladyship to let me out.

325
20:05.505 --> 20:07.065
What are you shouting for?

326
20:07.145 --> 20:08.305
You're not the only one locked up.

327
20:09.105 --> 20:11.265
An important ritual jade was stolen from the front hall.

328
20:11.345 --> 20:12.745
Lord Lu is furious.

329
20:12.825 --> 20:16.065
Even Steward Xu has been detained for negligence.

330
20:16.145 --> 20:17.705
All right, don't look so miserable.

331
20:17.785 --> 20:19.625
You've only been here two days.

332
20:19.705 --> 20:21.265
You clearly had nothing to do with the theft.

333
20:21.345 --> 20:23.025
Her Ladyship will speak up for you.

334
20:23.105 --> 20:24.185
Just wait.

335
20:24.745 --> 20:27.225
Miss Bitao, please put in another word for me

336
20:27.865 --> 20:29.505
and get me out soon.

337
20:29.585 --> 20:31.785
I still have work to do.

338
20:33.105 --> 20:34.625
I know. Just wait.

339
20:41.185 --> 20:43.145
CLANSMEN IN ROBES, UNITED IN CEREMONY

340
20:46.385 --> 20:47.585
I found the stolen item.

341
20:51.705 --> 20:53.905
But this isn't the jade tiger.

342
20:53.985 --> 20:55.265
You found it already?

343
20:55.945 --> 20:57.625
This thief is cunning,

344
20:57.705 --> 20:59.185
hiding it right under everyone's noses.

345
20:59.265 --> 21:00.665
Who would've thought?

346
21:03.305 --> 21:04.145
What is this?

347
21:04.225 --> 21:06.705
Someone means to have the Lu family wiped out

348
21:06.785 --> 21:08.145
and planted this to bring us ruin.

349
21:10.225 --> 21:11.265
If we hadn't searched for the stolen item,

350
21:12.065 --> 21:13.705
our whole family would eventually lose our heads.

351
21:13.785 --> 21:16.585
Throw every servant in the ancestral temple into the dungeon.

352
21:17.185 --> 21:18.785
I'll interrogate them myself!

353
21:19.385 --> 21:20.185
My Lord,

354
21:21.825 --> 21:23.945
even catching a snake calls for stealth.

355
21:24.465 --> 21:26.545
If you make such a show of hunting the thief,

356
21:26.625 --> 21:27.665
easy to spot the insider.

357
21:28.345 --> 21:29.705
What about an enemy from outside?

358
21:30.225 --> 21:31.065
We can't rush this.

359
21:34.185 --> 21:35.785
Zhao Song, Zhao Bai,

360
21:35.865 --> 21:37.305
release all the servants held in the rear rooms.

361
21:38.105 --> 21:40.305
-Release them? -Yes. All of them,

362
21:41.025 --> 21:42.385
except one.

363
21:47.785 --> 21:50.265
I've been wronged!

364
21:50.345 --> 21:52.025
Lord Lu!

365
21:52.105 --> 21:54.185
-I really didn't steal the jade tiger! -I told you it wasn't me!

366
21:54.265 --> 21:55.505
So you're the one who stole it!

367
21:55.585 --> 21:56.985
And you dragged all of us into it!

368
21:57.065 --> 21:57.945
All right, enough.

369
21:58.025 --> 21:58.945
-Lord Lu! -Break it up.

370
21:59.025 --> 22:00.025
Back to work!

371
22:01.345 --> 22:02.625
-Move along! -Let's go.

372
22:13.705 --> 22:18.425
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

373
22:28.065 --> 22:29.425
So they really were investigating a theft today.

374
22:30.265 --> 22:32.585
Good thing they didn't discover what's hidden here.

375
23:04.745 --> 23:07.265
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

376
23:13.065 --> 23:16.305
All right. Lady Lu finally has time to see you.

377
23:20.385 --> 23:21.745
My sister's come to pick us up?

378
23:21.825 --> 23:23.025
That's right.

379
23:23.825 --> 23:25.225
Hurry up and get ready.

380
23:25.305 --> 23:26.625
Put on something presentable.

381
23:27.145 --> 23:28.145
Then come with me,

382
23:28.225 --> 23:30.545
and you can finally be reunited.

383
23:46.305 --> 23:48.625
A-Chou wouldn't mention "The Tale of the Red Pill" for no reason.

384
23:49.225 --> 23:50.465
She was sending me a message.

385
23:51.145 --> 23:52.505
She wanted me to…

386
23:52.585 --> 23:53.465
Stop the carriage!

387
23:55.585 --> 23:57.305
Qi Zhongkai?

388
23:59.505 --> 24:00.665
What are you doing?

389
24:02.025 --> 24:04.705
Commandant Liu, my family's runaway slaves are in that carriage.

390
24:07.305 --> 24:08.425
Get them!

391
24:18.625 --> 24:19.505
Mother!

392
24:19.585 --> 24:20.825
-Get down! -Mother!

393
24:21.345 --> 24:22.705
-Mother! -Let's go!

394
24:23.545 --> 24:24.665
Hurry!

395
24:24.745 --> 24:25.465
Move! Hurry!

396
24:25.545 --> 24:26.225
Get down!

397
24:31.385 --> 24:32.505
Help!

398
24:32.585 --> 24:33.625
-Qi Zhongkai. -Help!

399
24:33.705 --> 24:36.545
How dare you gallop through the streets and openly seize people?

400
24:36.625 --> 24:38.465
Open your eyes and look carefully.

401
24:38.545 --> 24:40.665
This mother and her two children are runaway slaves from my household.

402
24:41.425 --> 24:42.785
I reported them to the authorities three days ago.

403
24:43.385 --> 24:44.905
You harbored my family's runaway slaves.

404
24:44.985 --> 24:46.425
I'll settle that score with you later.

405
24:46.505 --> 24:47.945
You've gone too far!

406
24:48.025 --> 24:48.905
Move!

407
24:53.905 --> 24:55.705
-My Lord! -Move!

408
24:56.225 --> 24:57.305
There's still one here!

409
25:01.145 --> 25:02.145
Good.

410
25:02.225 --> 25:06.185
As long as we have her, the plan won't fail.

411
25:07.065 --> 25:13.225
Do exactly as I say, or I'll skin you alive.

412
25:15.705 --> 25:17.625
My Lord, it's almost time for the Lu family's ancestral rite.

413
25:17.705 --> 25:19.065
No rush.

414
25:20.585 --> 25:22.305
Everything is ready,

415
25:23.585 --> 25:26.505
but I'm still waiting for an honored guest.

416
25:29.825 --> 25:30.985
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

417
25:34.825 --> 25:37.705
LU FAMILY'S ANCESTRAL TABLETS

418
25:37.785 --> 25:39.585
Welcome the deities!

419
25:39.665 --> 25:45.425
ILLUSTRIOUS FAMILY LEGACY

420
25:47.585 --> 25:48.585
Kneel!

421
25:53.745 --> 25:56.545
On the 15th day of the seventh month, at this auspicious hour,

422
25:56.625 --> 25:59.705
incense rises as the spirits come from afar.

423
25:59.785 --> 26:02.545
Ancestors, descend and receive our grain and offerings.

424
26:02.625 --> 26:06.025
With reverence, we present these worthy sacrifices.

425
26:06.105 --> 26:09.425
Accept these offerings and witness our sincerity.

426
26:09.505 --> 26:12.625
May our ancestors descend and partake,

427
26:12.705 --> 26:14.705
and be comforted by our filial devotion!

428
26:48.665 --> 26:50.505
Prince Rong arrives!

429
26:50.585 --> 26:52.545
This is our ancestral temple. You may not barge in!

430
26:52.625 --> 26:53.545
Move aside!

431
26:54.585 --> 26:56.185
-What are you doing? -What's this?

432
26:56.705 --> 26:57.785
-What are you doing? -Move!

433
26:57.865 --> 26:58.985
This is no place for you to cause trouble!

434
26:59.065 --> 27:00.545
Stop at once!

435
27:06.665 --> 27:08.585
PRINCE RONG, THE EMPEROR'S YOUNGER BROTHER

436
27:10.465 --> 27:12.985
My Lord, who is he?

437
27:13.065 --> 27:16.305
The Empress Dowager's youngest son and His Majesty's younger brother,

438
27:17.305 --> 27:19.425
Prince Rong, who backed Han Liao for military command.

439
27:34.385 --> 27:38.465
Your Highness, forgive me for not welcoming you sooner.

440
27:48.705 --> 27:50.985
I ran into a mad dog on the way,

441
27:51.585 --> 27:53.505
and it caused me to fall from my horse.

442
27:53.585 --> 27:56.025
I've defiled your family's ancestral temple.

443
27:56.105 --> 27:56.945
My apologies.

444
27:58.705 --> 27:59.945
My apologies.

445
28:01.225 --> 28:02.305
Bring her in!

446
28:25.585 --> 28:28.625
-Your Highness… -Please, just be patient for now.

447
28:29.785 --> 28:34.345
I came here today to help your family catch a thief.

448
28:34.425 --> 28:36.025
A thief?

449
28:36.105 --> 28:38.665
Your Highness must be joking.

450
28:38.745 --> 28:40.225
This is the Lu family's ancestral temple,

451
28:40.305 --> 28:43.105
where we worship our ancestors.

452
28:43.185 --> 28:44.625
What thief could there be here?

453
28:48.505 --> 28:49.705
Take a good look.

454
28:51.305 --> 28:52.145
Who is she?

455
29:01.985 --> 29:03.665
During the recent war with the Hutuo,

456
29:04.185 --> 29:06.105
the Empress Dowager recommended Your Highness for command twice.

457
29:06.185 --> 29:09.945
But the Lu family kept obstructing you at every turn,

458
29:10.905 --> 29:12.425
until His Majesty grew suspicious

459
29:12.505 --> 29:14.545
and refused to entrust you with military command.

460
29:14.625 --> 29:18.305
Now, removing this threat is not difficult.

461
29:19.025 --> 29:20.265
Just follow my plan.

462
29:20.785 --> 29:22.785
First, we'll convict the Lu family of using an impostor

463
29:22.865 --> 29:24.585
to deceive the sovereign.

464
29:25.345 --> 29:27.105
Then we'll use that as grounds for a thorough search.

465
29:27.185 --> 29:31.625
Once we find an imperial ritual vessel hidden in the Lu ancestral temple…

466
29:32.225 --> 29:33.665
Are you absolutely certain it'll work?

467
29:33.745 --> 29:34.825
Rest assured, Your Highness.

468
29:34.905 --> 29:38.345
I call this plan "Snaring the Dragon and Binding the Tiger."

469
29:38.425 --> 29:42.305
It will leave Lu dead, his clan destroyed,

470
29:43.065 --> 29:44.905
and everything reduced to ashes.

471
29:46.705 --> 29:48.345
Oh, Lu Zhuo.

472
29:48.425 --> 29:50.025
For all your famed shrewdness,

473
29:50.105 --> 29:53.385
you've still been blinded by beauty and fallen for this woman's charms!

474
29:54.185 --> 29:57.545
Take a good look at the lovely wife by your side.

475
29:57.625 --> 29:59.865
Is she truly a noble lady from the Earl of Cheng'an's household,

476
29:59.945 --> 30:01.105
or…

477
30:02.865 --> 30:04.865
Han Liao, who gave you leave to cause trouble here?

478
30:09.025 --> 30:10.665
Everyone here can see for themselves!

479
30:11.625 --> 30:12.945
Take a good look.

480
30:13.025 --> 30:17.545
The wife of the heir to the Duke of Ying is this girl's elder sister!

481
30:18.785 --> 30:20.785
She's no noble lady from an earl's household.

482
30:21.865 --> 30:26.385
She's a criminal from the slums with blood on her hands!

483
30:27.225 --> 30:28.425
-What? -How can it be?

484
30:28.505 --> 30:29.545
That's not possible.

485
30:32.425 --> 30:34.425
How will he know?

486
30:40.425 --> 30:41.345
Miss,

487
30:42.865 --> 30:46.545
this is her Ladyship of the Duke of Ying's household.

488
30:46.625 --> 30:48.145
Take a good look.

489
30:48.745 --> 30:50.625
Is she really your sister?

490
30:56.185 --> 30:57.985
Sister, save me!

491
30:58.065 --> 30:59.745
It's me, Hongxian!

492
30:59.825 --> 31:01.985
She can't even recognize her own sister?

493
31:02.065 --> 31:05.065
Lord Han, what a fine witness you've found.

494
31:05.945 --> 31:07.225
You've got the wrong person.

495
31:07.825 --> 31:10.105
She's Lord Lu's wife.

496
31:11.985 --> 31:13.705
Your Ladyship, I was wrong!

497
31:13.785 --> 31:15.465
I never meant to frame you!

498
31:16.065 --> 31:18.425
It was him! He forced me to do it!

499
31:18.945 --> 31:21.065
You wretch! How dare you give false testimony?

500
31:22.945 --> 31:24.865
Don't be afraid.

501
31:27.025 --> 31:28.585
Han Liao must have abducted you

502
31:28.665 --> 31:30.385
and brought you here for a reason.

503
31:32.185 --> 31:33.025
Take your time.

504
31:33.785 --> 31:34.985
Tell us everything.

505
31:35.065 --> 31:38.585
The Duke of Ying's household will see justice done.

506
31:41.745 --> 31:44.145
Your Graces, save me!

507
31:44.985 --> 31:47.265
I came to the capital with my mother to seek treatment.

508
31:47.345 --> 31:50.905
Somehow, I was abducted and taught a whole story to recite.

509
31:51.585 --> 31:52.825
What did he tell you to say?

510
31:52.905 --> 31:53.825
Nonsense!

511
31:54.625 --> 31:55.545
Let her speak!

512
32:00.105 --> 32:01.345
If you keep spouting nonsense,

513
32:02.225 --> 32:03.625
I'll break every bone in your body!

514
32:03.705 --> 32:04.905
Enough!

515
32:04.985 --> 32:09.385
How dare you threaten her right in front of me?

516
32:10.785 --> 32:11.745
Go on. Tell us everything.

517
32:12.425 --> 32:15.265
He told me to call her Ladyship my sister

518
32:15.785 --> 32:17.625
and accuse her of being an impostor,

519
32:17.705 --> 32:19.545
so he could cause trouble for the Lu family.

520
32:20.465 --> 32:22.945
I'm just an illiterate country girl.

521
32:23.025 --> 32:25.385
I couldn't even remember all the lies he made up.

522
32:25.465 --> 32:28.265
I told him I wouldn't do it, but he forced me.

523
32:28.865 --> 32:30.385
He said if I refused to come,

524
32:31.305 --> 32:33.985
he'd kill my mother!

525
32:39.785 --> 32:42.265
Old Madam Wei was at our house for a banquet not long ago.

526
32:42.345 --> 32:44.785
Neither her own grandmother nor anyone in the Wei family

527
32:44.865 --> 32:47.745
found anything wrong.

528
32:47.825 --> 32:50.385
Yet an outsider like you claims to know better?

529
32:50.465 --> 32:52.905
How utterly absurd.

530
32:53.505 --> 32:54.785
To fabricate evidence against someone,

531
32:54.865 --> 32:56.345
you've concocted an outrageous lie.

532
32:56.425 --> 32:57.345
How utterly shameless.

533
32:58.345 --> 32:59.705
Miss, we're here for you.

534
32:59.785 --> 33:00.665
Don't be afraid.

535
33:01.705 --> 33:02.545
You villain!

536
33:03.065 --> 33:05.505
How dare you slander Lady Rao? Get out!

537
33:05.585 --> 33:07.385
-Get out! -Stop them!

538
33:07.465 --> 33:08.505
-Get out! -Go!

539
33:08.585 --> 33:09.425
Stop them!

540
33:09.505 --> 33:10.425
-Stop! -Get out!

541
33:10.505 --> 33:11.385
This is outrageous!

542
33:13.025 --> 33:14.225
Han Liao,

543
33:15.665 --> 33:18.585
show us your conclusive evidence.

544
33:21.065 --> 33:25.185
You think a petty trick like that can save you?

545
33:25.265 --> 33:26.665
You're dreaming!

546
33:27.785 --> 33:30.505
I was never worried about this wretch changing her story.

547
33:30.585 --> 33:33.265
It's too late to plug a leak once the boat is midstream.

548
33:33.345 --> 33:34.505
Once I produce the hard evidence,

549
33:34.585 --> 33:36.505
let's see how your family gets out of this!

550
33:56.945 --> 33:58.425
You brought someone for me to meet.

551
33:58.505 --> 33:59.585
What a coincidence.

552
34:00.425 --> 34:03.345
I also have someone I'd like you to meet.

553
34:04.665 --> 34:05.665
Zhao Song, Zhao Bai,

554
34:07.145 --> 34:08.344
bring him in!

555
34:13.665 --> 34:15.105
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

556
34:21.105 --> 34:24.185
Lu Zhuo, what exactly is going on?

557
34:25.304 --> 34:28.784
What was he looking for in our ancestral temple?

558
34:41.185 --> 34:42.344
A gold ritual vessel?

559
34:43.545 --> 34:45.344
He planted this man here

560
34:46.105 --> 34:48.425
to hide gold ritual vessel reserved for the Emperor,

561
34:49.145 --> 34:51.225
so he could accuse us of violating ritual codes

562
34:51.905 --> 34:53.665
and have our entire clan executed.

563
34:54.585 --> 34:57.905
Han Liao stormed our ancestral temple for one purpose alone.

564
34:58.465 --> 34:59.625
He is here to find it!

565
35:00.425 --> 35:02.905
How could something so appalling happen?

566
35:03.505 --> 35:06.305
What grudge could be so deep to wipe out our entire clan?

567
35:06.385 --> 35:07.905
How vicious the Han family is!

568
35:07.985 --> 35:10.105
They're declaring war on the Lu family!

569
35:11.105 --> 35:13.785
You knew all along and set a trap just for me!

570
35:13.865 --> 35:14.745
This is nothing but slander.

571
35:15.585 --> 35:16.625
Guards!

572
35:20.985 --> 35:22.665
How could you be so reckless?

573
35:23.265 --> 35:25.105
Are you hurt? Let me see.

574
35:25.185 --> 35:27.265
Han Liao, you shameless villain!

575
35:28.265 --> 35:30.465
No wonder you hurled false accusations and tried every way to frame me.

576
35:31.145 --> 35:34.465
It was all an excuse to search our ancestral temple.

577
35:34.545 --> 35:37.265
You planted evidence and framed a loyal family,

578
35:37.345 --> 35:39.265
smashed our altar and dishonored our ancestors,

579
35:39.345 --> 35:42.105
and even tried to destroy the entire Lu clan!

580
35:42.745 --> 35:44.785
One crime after another.

581
35:44.865 --> 35:47.145
You have the heart of a jackal and the venom of a wasp.

582
35:47.225 --> 35:49.705
To destroy a house and ruin a clan, a crime beyond forgiveness.

583
35:58.505 --> 36:01.265
The forebears of the Lu family gave their lives for the nation,

584
36:01.345 --> 36:03.065
shedding their blood on the battlefield.

585
36:03.145 --> 36:07.065
And even in death, their spirits are denied peace.

586
36:08.705 --> 36:10.585
Even if the Lu family killed you here and now,

587
36:10.665 --> 36:12.825
you'd only be getting what you deserve!

588
36:16.025 --> 36:18.745
We've been grievously wronged!

589
36:22.985 --> 36:24.945
You despicable lackey!

590
36:25.025 --> 36:26.945
You've gone too far!

591
36:27.025 --> 36:28.505
Do you really think the Lu family has no men left?

592
36:28.585 --> 36:29.665
You monster!

593
36:29.745 --> 36:31.145
-Men of the Lu family, -He's bullying the widows

594
36:31.225 --> 36:33.105
-can you stand by and watch this? -and orphans in our family!

595
36:33.185 --> 36:36.105
This villain wrecked our temple and dishonored our ancestors.

596
36:36.785 --> 36:39.265
Anyone with Lu blood in his veins cannot let him off!

597
36:39.345 --> 36:41.065
Our ancestors are watching.

598
36:41.145 --> 36:43.145
We have to destroy this villain!

599
36:43.745 --> 36:45.065
-Get him! -Shut the gates!

600
36:45.665 --> 36:47.585
Don't let a single one escape! Get lost!

601
36:48.545 --> 36:49.625
Get lost!

602
36:55.825 --> 36:57.985
-Protect the ladies. -Yes.

603
36:58.065 --> 37:00.025
-Let's go. What an outrage! -Go!

604
37:00.105 --> 37:01.265
Zhuo…

605
37:11.145 --> 37:13.705
What disgraceful behavior! Stop!

606
37:16.465 --> 37:17.665
Beat them!

607
37:17.745 --> 37:18.985
Beat every last one of them!

608
37:20.105 --> 37:23.665
The Lu family helped the Founding Emperor conquer this realm.

609
37:23.745 --> 37:27.265
For generations, we've given our all and sworn to serve the nation unto death!

610
37:27.945 --> 37:30.065
So many died on the battlefield.

611
37:30.145 --> 37:32.385
Three of my sons never came home.

612
37:33.105 --> 37:34.545
You dare smash our ancestral temple,

613
37:34.625 --> 37:37.225
disturb our honored dead, and accuse us of treason?

614
37:38.145 --> 37:39.705
Even before His Majesty,

615
37:39.785 --> 37:41.545
I'd still have you beaten!

616
37:41.625 --> 37:43.905
Beat them! Beat every last one of them!

617
37:43.985 --> 37:47.625
Any man who holds back is unworthy of being a man of the Lu family!

618
37:47.705 --> 37:50.105
Hit them! Hit them hard!

619
37:50.185 --> 37:52.185
Oh, you! Unbelievable!

620
37:59.305 --> 38:00.265
I'm His Majesty's brother!

621
38:00.345 --> 38:01.425
How dare you hit me!

622
38:02.545 --> 38:03.505
Coward!

623
38:05.785 --> 38:06.905
Hit him!

624
38:10.905 --> 38:11.745
You hit me!

625
38:19.665 --> 38:21.425
You set me up.

626
38:22.905 --> 38:24.265
Good thing you were here, My Lord.

627
38:32.145 --> 38:32.985
Get up!

628
38:44.745 --> 38:47.425
Lu Zhuo, come with me to the palace.

629
38:53.705 --> 38:55.185
Wait for me.

630
39:07.665 --> 39:10.785
Oh, Rao, you were far too reckless.

631
39:10.865 --> 39:13.505
Exactly. What if a punch had scarred your face?

632
39:13.585 --> 39:15.265
What would you do then?

633
39:15.345 --> 39:17.825
As long as there's one man left in the Lu family,

634
39:17.905 --> 39:20.665
they'd never let the ladies risk lives.

635
39:20.745 --> 39:22.185
If anything like this happens again,

636
39:22.265 --> 39:23.425
you mustn't put yourself in danger.

637
39:26.905 --> 39:30.785
Rao, you were fearless in the face of danger and acted with such courage.

638
39:31.585 --> 39:35.105
Everyone, look. Now that's a true lady of the Lu family!

639
39:40.665 --> 39:43.505
Zhuo is truly fortunate.

640
39:49.785 --> 39:51.345
Mother, stop hitting me! Please, Mother!

641
39:51.425 --> 39:53.345
You helped outsiders plot against your sister,

642
39:54.465 --> 39:56.665
-you heartless beast! -Mother, I was wrong!

643
39:56.745 --> 39:57.585
You deserve it.

644
39:58.185 --> 39:59.305
The Tale of the Red Pill is about Ruiniang,

645
39:59.385 --> 40:02.105
who was abducted by villains and used her wits to escape.

646
40:02.185 --> 40:04.505
I knew at once you were warning me

647
40:04.585 --> 40:06.345
that Han Liao was up to no good.

648
40:08.105 --> 40:09.145
I was wrong.

649
40:09.225 --> 40:11.665
Liangcai will arrange for you to go to Anling.

650
40:11.745 --> 40:13.905
There's a retired Imperial Physician Wang there

651
40:13.985 --> 40:15.785
who specializes in treating wasting illnesses.

652
40:15.865 --> 40:18.065
I've prepared a letter of introduction and his fee.

653
40:18.745 --> 40:20.265
Take this box with you.

654
40:20.865 --> 40:24.305
Han Liao and the Wei family are all trying to harm you.

655
40:24.985 --> 40:26.625
Why not come with us?

656
40:29.985 --> 40:30.945
My daughter,

657
40:31.465 --> 40:34.065
you should get away while you still can.

658
40:42.585 --> 40:43.465
Once you reach Anling,

659
40:44.145 --> 40:45.665
as soon as your escorts leave,

660
40:45.745 --> 40:47.625
head straight to Yong County to find Imperial Physician Wang.

661
40:48.825 --> 40:49.705
So he isn't in Anling?

662
40:50.305 --> 40:53.185
Don't worry. I understand.

663
40:53.265 --> 40:55.745
Other than you, I trust no one.

664
41:01.025 --> 41:02.025
My dear brother,

665
41:02.105 --> 41:03.465
you thought Lord Han was powerful, didn't you?

666
41:06.865 --> 41:08.185
But with just a little maneuvering,

667
41:08.265 --> 41:10.745
I exposed his plot and had him thrown in prison.

668
41:12.025 --> 41:14.625
Don't ever follow his example. Otherwise…

669
41:17.265 --> 41:19.145
I dreamed about Pa last night.

670
41:19.945 --> 41:21.065
He said he missed you.

671
41:22.025 --> 41:23.705
I… I'll

672
41:23.785 --> 41:26.065
take good care of Mother and Hongxian from now on.

673
41:26.145 --> 41:27.945
I'll never defy you again!

674
41:28.025 --> 41:29.665
If you say east, I dare not go west.

675
41:29.745 --> 41:31.505
If you say shoo the dog, I dare not chase the chicken.

676
41:31.585 --> 41:33.945
Otherwise, may Heaven strike me with lightning!

677
41:41.705 --> 41:44.665
CHANGLE PALACE

678
41:48.865 --> 41:50.305
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

679
41:50.385 --> 41:52.465
The Eldest Princess has gone in to talk to the Empress Dowager.

680
41:52.545 --> 41:54.305
She'll surely calm her down.

681
42:07.705 --> 42:08.905
Your Majesty,

682
42:09.785 --> 42:11.465
Xiao is your own brother.

683
42:11.545 --> 42:13.385
He's always been rash by nature.

684
42:13.465 --> 42:16.185
Outsiders have simply led him astray.

685
42:16.905 --> 42:19.705
Why not forgive him this once,

686
42:19.785 --> 42:21.425
so Mother won't worry herself sick?

687
42:21.505 --> 42:23.185
She still refuses to eat.

688
42:23.265 --> 42:26.105
As her children, how can we bear to see that?

689
42:26.185 --> 42:28.585
This isn't the first time he's acted so recklessly.

690
42:29.545 --> 42:31.985
Everyone knows Mother dotes on her youngest son.

691
42:32.585 --> 42:34.905
Their bond is the envy of all.

692
42:34.985 --> 42:36.305
But in this world,

693
42:36.385 --> 42:38.985
Prince Rong isn't the only one with a mother!

694
42:39.065 --> 42:41.025
Wasn't everyone else born and raised by parents too?

695
42:41.105 --> 42:43.745
Don't they revere their ancestors and honor their parents?

696
42:44.825 --> 42:45.665
And what did he do?

697
42:45.745 --> 42:47.945
He stormed the Lu family's ancestral temple

698
42:48.025 --> 42:50.625
and desecrated the spirits of loyal men without cause,

699
42:50.705 --> 42:51.785
causing an uproar throughout the capital.

700
42:52.385 --> 42:54.065
Sister, go outside and see for yourself.

701
42:54.145 --> 42:56.025
Right now, the censors are blocking the palace gates.

702
42:56.105 --> 42:59.025
asking me to severely punish Prince Rong and the Hans for their crimes.

703
42:59.625 --> 43:01.945
Tell me, as Emperor, what am I supposed to do?

704
43:02.025 --> 43:04.225
-I… -He may as well kill his own brother

705
43:04.305 --> 43:06.985
and never come see me again!

706
43:08.425 --> 43:10.425
Your Majesty, you…

707
43:10.505 --> 43:14.705
CHANGLE PALACE

708
43:15.305 --> 43:17.105
Has she forgotten that

709
43:18.385 --> 43:20.265
this man she's threatening with a hunger strike

710
43:21.745 --> 43:23.625
is also her own son?

711
43:26.185 --> 43:28.185
Your Majesty!

712
43:36.025 --> 43:39.505
ZHOU FU, LADY LI OF HANDSOME FAIRNESS

713
44:32.785 --> 44:33.785
Who told you to come?

714
44:33.865 --> 44:36.865
I was taking a nap in my chambers this afternoon

715
44:36.945 --> 44:39.505
when I dreamed of a tiny man

716
44:39.585 --> 44:41.145
crawling out from my pillow.

717
44:41.225 --> 44:44.105
He gave me a hard shove and shouted,

718
44:44.185 --> 44:48.825
"Wake up! Someone has wronged His Majesty!

719
44:49.425 --> 44:52.105
Hurry and go check on him!"

720
44:53.985 --> 44:55.105
You're always talking nonsense.

721
45:00.425 --> 45:02.065
Who's wronged Your Majesty?

722
45:02.145 --> 45:03.185
Tell me.

723
45:03.265 --> 45:04.585
I'll go teach them a lesson.

724
45:04.665 --> 45:06.585
A tiny man came to you in a dream?

725
45:07.665 --> 45:09.985
Everyone knows my sister is the one who keeps you informed.

726
45:11.105 --> 45:15.145
Don't you know exactly what's on my mind?

727
45:21.105 --> 45:22.585
Your Majesty,

728
45:22.665 --> 45:25.025
the Empress Dowager has always doted on Prince Rong.

729
45:25.105 --> 45:27.265
She couldn't bear to send him back to his fief,

730
45:27.345 --> 45:29.785
so she kept him in the capital for two whole years.

731
45:30.425 --> 45:32.865
She built him a grand residence

732
45:32.945 --> 45:35.585
and showered him with jewels and treasures.

733
45:36.105 --> 45:37.585
In her eyes,

734
45:37.665 --> 45:40.145
Prince Rong has only made a few minor mistakes.

735
45:40.225 --> 45:44.265
As his brother, can't Your Majesty show him some leniency?

736
45:46.945 --> 45:50.025
I've turned a blind eye to all his past misconduct

737
45:50.105 --> 45:51.945
solely out of respect for Mother.

738
45:52.025 --> 45:56.345
But now, he nearly had the entire Lu family executed,

739
45:57.225 --> 45:59.825
shook the foundations of the state, and provoked public outrage.

740
45:59.905 --> 46:01.945
Yet Mother still wants me to spare him.

741
46:02.025 --> 46:05.745
I might as well give up the throne and hand everything over to him.

742
46:06.265 --> 46:08.985
Perhaps then Mother will finally be satisfied!

743
46:10.585 --> 46:12.145
Then why not execute Prince Rong?

744
46:17.665 --> 46:19.625
He's the apple of the Empress Dowager's eye.

745
46:20.345 --> 46:22.025
You simply cannot kill him.

746
46:22.105 --> 46:26.305
If you can't kill him, why not let him off?

747
46:26.385 --> 46:27.905
Let him off?

748
46:29.625 --> 46:31.825
Then how should I face the Lu family?

749
46:31.905 --> 46:35.065
And how am I to govern my officials or calm the public outrage?

750
46:38.945 --> 46:41.545
If I give Your Majesty a solution,

751
46:41.625 --> 46:43.545
how will you reward me?

752
46:45.305 --> 46:46.305
Let's hear it.

753
46:47.785 --> 46:49.585
If Prince Rong committed no grave offense,

754
46:49.665 --> 46:51.385
then the fault must lie with someone else.

755
46:53.345 --> 46:55.745
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

756
47:00.425 --> 47:03.545
Where on earth did you run off to?

757
47:03.625 --> 47:05.585
Mother has been waiting for ages.

758
47:06.825 --> 47:07.665
Greetings, Grandmother.

759
47:08.825 --> 47:10.945
If you need anything, just send for me.

760
47:11.545 --> 47:13.145
How could I keep you waiting?

761
47:13.745 --> 47:16.265
Rao, an oral decree has come from the palace.

762
47:16.345 --> 47:19.025
His Majesty wants to see you and Zhuo.

763
47:21.825 --> 47:23.145
His Majesty's summons

764
47:23.865 --> 47:25.345
must be about the case of Prince Rong and Han Liao.

765
47:26.505 --> 47:27.905
If His Majesty wants answers,

766
47:27.985 --> 47:29.785
he can question you or your grandfather.

767
47:29.865 --> 47:33.865
At worst, he could summon every man in our household.

768
47:34.385 --> 47:37.305
Why would he summon Rao for no reason?

769
47:40.785 --> 47:44.145
Perhaps someone in the palace

770
47:44.225 --> 47:46.225
wants a chance to meet the Lu family's new bride.

771
47:49.145 --> 47:51.025
Could it be Lady Li in the palace,

772
47:51.705 --> 47:53.705
Lady Wei Rao's birth mother, who wants to see me?

773
47:56.305 --> 47:58.265
Mother and Fourth Aunt will help you prepare.

774
47:59.225 --> 48:02.705
In an hour, we'll set out to the palace and meet His Majesty.

775
48:04.625 --> 48:05.665
Yes.

776
50:18.825 --> 50:21.385
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
